  "designNotes": "A dark, authoritative palette of ink and navy (#0f1724, #1a2b45) with copper accents (#b87333, #d49563) and marble-white text. The hero layers a giant, faint serif \"BLAND\" watermark over a night view of the Miami skyline, with a cut-out portrait of Gerald R. Bland on the right and the two-line promise \"Focused on solutions. / Driven by results.\" set in Marcellus, the second line in copper. Manrope handles body copy and tracked-uppercase buttons, while thin vertical rules and a vertical name caption give the page a structured, editorial feel. Practice areas sit in tabs annotated with Florida Statutes chapters, and the page closes with review excerpts, two office cards and a detailed consultation form.",
  "businessSummary": "Bland Law, P.A. is a family law, traffic and criminal defense firm led by Gerald R. Bland, Esq., with offices on Coral Way in Miami and Glades Road in Boca Raton. It serves Miami-Dade, Broward and Palm Beach counties in English and Spanish and has practiced since 2013.",
  "keyCopy": [
    "Focused on solutions. Driven by results.",
